@startuml
title Nhân viên xác nhận COD và phát hành hóa đơn
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Employee
boundary AdminPortal
control API
control AdminOrderService
control InvoiceService
entity PostgreSQL

Employee->AdminPortal: Xác nhận đã thu tiền COD
AdminPortal->API: POST /admin/orders/:orderId/mark-paid
API->AdminOrderService: Verify active employee JWT
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: BEGIN and lock order
PostgreSQL-->AdminOrderService: Packed unpaid COD order
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: Set payment status paid and confirmer
AdminOrderService->InvoiceService: Issue invoice for paid order
InvoiceService->PostgreSQL: INSERT unique invoice snapshot
PostgreSQL-->InvoiceService: Invoice issued
AdminOrderService->PostgreSQL: COMMIT transaction
PostgreSQL-->AdminOrderService: Paid order and invoice
API-->AdminPortal: 200 paid order
AdminPortal-->Employee: Hiển thị trạng thái đã thanh toán
@enduml
